<fo:block keep-with-next="always" border-bottom-width="thin" border-bottom-style="none" space-after="0.750em" space-before="0.750em" font-weight="bold" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10pt" start-indent="0in">Professional Objective</fo:block>
<fo:block space-after="0.750em">
    Seeking a leadership role in an innovative company that will allow
    me to utilize my broad experience base and advanced technical and
    management skills to help that company become more successful.
  </fo:block>
<fo:block keep-with-next="always" border-bottom-width="thin" border-bottom-style="none" space-after="0.750em" space-before="0.750em" font-weight="bold" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10pt" start-indent="0in">Miscellany</fo:block>
<fo:block space-after="0.750em">
    A computing professional with more than 25 years of extensive
    experience.  A wide background in computing, networking and
    client/server environments.  Strong software architecture and
    development skills.  Extensive experience with Sun Solaris, Linux,
    other versions of UNIX, network applications and Cisco routers.
    Strong project management skills, including managing large-scale
    projects and teams.  Self-starter with a strong work ethic.  Quick
    learner.  Extensive documentation and presentation skills.
  </fo:block>
<fo:block keep-with-next="always" border-bottom-width="thin" border-bottom-style="none" space-after="0.750em" space-before="0.750em" font-weight="bold" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10pt" start-indent="0in">Employment History</fo:block>
